Author: OcarinaMod

Version:
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets:
    - 0x00033500

Title: ocarina (microphone songs)

Summary: whistle or hum an ocarina song with the ocarina out; the game plays it, or asks '<song>?' with its own Yes/No box.

Description: |
  While the ocarina is out (message state 6) the plugin listens to the microphone, detects notes and matches the
  12 ocarina songs. A clear phrase is played by pressing the song's buttons (OR-ed into the game's pad state, real
  presses still work). A phrase that looks like several songs asks '<song>?' with the game's native Yes/No text box,
  one candidate at a time. Log in /ocarina/log.txt (written only while the ocarina is put away).

Compatibility: Console

MemorySize: 2MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false

EventsSelfManaged: true

